        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: lo scontro",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "lo scontro — \"the crash, the collision; the clash\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sull'autostrada c'è stato uno scontro tra due camion. There was a crash between two lorries on the motorway."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a clash of ideas or of teams."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "scontro is built on scontrare, a form of incontrare \"to meet\", from Latin in contrā \"against\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
